      "title": "Tic-Tac-Toe Game: The \"Game Over\" Screen & Checking for a Draw",
      "sourceHash": "ce3a9fb5b61b6595e4922c08667b29aa29fd6dc39a63136b9a752abf83d701e6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 2.67,
          "en": "So now to complete this app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.67,
          "end": 7.17,
          "en": "let's add a last new component, a GameOver component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.17,
          "end": 10.71,
          "en": "which should be shown if, well, the game is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.71,
          "end": 13.95,
          "en": "And the idea here is simply to have a nice screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.95,
          "end": 17.97,
          "en": "that shows us who won and also to show a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.97,
          "end": 20.7,
          "en": "that allows us to restart the game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.7,
          "end": 23.7,
          "en": "So for that here I'll again export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.7,
          "end": 25.863,
          "en": "this GameOver component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.09,
          "end": 30.57,
          "en": "and then in there we can return a div, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.57,
          "end": 33.33,
          "en": "with an ID of game-over,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.33,
          "end": 35.853,
          "en": "which I add for styling purposes again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.05,
          "end": 39.42,
          "en": "And in there we can add a H2 element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.42,
          "end": 42.513,
          "en": "where we say game over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.22,
          "end": 49.22,
          "en": "And then here I expect to get the symbol or name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.5,
          "end": 54.333,
          "en": "of the winner as a prop so that we can output it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.17,
          "end": 59.31,
          "en": "and it's of course also possible that we'll have a draw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 59.31,
          "end": 61.38,
          "en": "So we'll have to check for that as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.38,
          "end": 63.243,
          "en": "in our app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.41,
          "end": 68.82,
          "en": "But for a start, let's simply output the name of the winner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.82,
          "end": 73.34,
          "en": "by adding a paragraph here where we simply say winner won.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 77.46000000000001,
          "end": 79.62,
          "en": "And below that I'll add another paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 79.62,
          "end": 81.33,
          "en": "which contains a button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 84.27,
          "en": "which should allow us to restart the game,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.27,
          "end": 86.40299999999999,
          "en": "and we'll add the logic for this later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.81,
          "end": 90.96000000000001,
          "en": "So now with this basic GameOver component added back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 90.96000000000001,
          "end": 94.62,
          "en": "in the app component, we should use this GameOver component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 94.62,
          "end": 96.37,
          "en": "here if we have a winner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.1,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "and therefore here we can import GameOver",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 106.417,
          "en": "from dot slash components GameOver.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 108.50999999999999,
          "end": 113.043,
          "en": "And use this component down here if we have a winner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 114.18,
          "end": 116.34,
          "en": "And of course now we need to pass the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 116.34,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "or symbol of the winner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 121.5,
          "en": "through that winner prop to the GameOver component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 121.5,
          "end": 123.75,
          "en": "and at the moment we only have the symbol",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 123.75,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "in this winner variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 127.383,
          "en": "so that's what I'm going to pass here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 130.41,
          "end": 133.32,
          "en": "Now with that, if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 133.32,
          "end": 136.983,
          "en": "if I win here, I got this game over screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 139.77,
          "en": "Of course this button here doesn't work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 139.77,
          "end": 141.39,
          "en": "but we got the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 141.39,
          "end": 145.07999999999998,
          "en": "But a problem we'll face is that at the moment we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 145.07999999999998,
          "end": 149.223,
          "en": "of course also can end up with a draw,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 150.63,
          "end": 152.25,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 152.25,
          "end": 154.8,
          "en": "And in that case, I of course also want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 154.8,
          "end": 156.393,
          "en": "to get the game over screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 157.41,
          "end": 161.67000000000002,
          "en": "So we should adjust our logic here in the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 161.67000000000002,
          "end": 165.93,
          "en": "where we derive the winner and also handle the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 165.93,
          "end": 167.82,
          "en": "that we got a draw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 171.12,
          "en": "So the question, of course, is how do we know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 171.12,
          "end": 173.22,
          "en": "that we have a draw?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 173.22,
          "end": 175.68,
          "en": "Well, we're checking all the winning combinations here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.68,
          "end": 177.88,
          "en": "So we'll definitely know if we have a winner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.74,
          "end": 183.3,
          "en": "and we'll have a draw if we populated all fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 183.3,
          "end": 188.073,
          "en": "And we know that we'll always have exactly nine fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 189.18,
          "end": 191.19,
          "en": "So therefore, of course, we also know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 194.82,
          "en": "that we'll have at most nine game turns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 194.82,
          "end": 196.77,
          "en": "I mean you can see that in the log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 196.77,
          "end": 199.323,
          "en": "We have nine entries here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 200.49,
          "end": 202.74,
          "en": "So we know that we have a draw,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 202.74,
          "end": 205.29,
          "en": "maybe here after deriving a winner,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.29,
          "end": 206.94,
          "en": "if we don't have a winner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 206.94,
          "end": 210.09,
          "en": "but we have nine turns in that game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.09,
          "end": 214.05,
          "en": "So we could add a constant that's named hasDraw,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 214.05,
          "end": 219.05,
          "en": "which should be true if gameTurns.length is equal to nine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.38,
          "end": 224.553,
          "en": "So if we had nine turns in that game and not winner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.96,
          "end": 228.45,
          "en": "So we had all the turns we can possibly have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 228.45,
          "end": 229.74,
          "en": "but we don't have a winner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 229.74,
          "end": 231.333,
          "en": "In that case, we have a draw,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.53,
          "end": 236.56,
          "en": "and we can now use this hasDraw constant down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 237.72,
          "end": 242.22,
          "en": "to show the game over screen if we have a winner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 242.22,
          "end": 246.27,
          "en": "or hasDraw is truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 246.27,
          "end": 248.76,
          "en": "and we should wrap this here with parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 248.76,
          "end": 250.923,
          "en": "to make sure that this is checked first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.18,
          "end": 256.26,
          "en": "So if we have a winner or hasDraw is true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.26,
          "end": 259.32,
          "en": "the GameOver component will be displayed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 259.32,
          "end": 262.35,
          "en": "and inside of the GameOver component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 262.35,
          "end": 265.63,
          "en": "we now know that winner will not always be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 266.7,
          "end": 270.21,
          "en": "because it's possible that this GameOver component is shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 270.21,
          "end": 273.48,
          "en": "because we have a draw, not because we have a winner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 273.48,
          "end": 276.42,
          "en": "So winner might be undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 276.42,
          "end": 280.14,
          "en": "and therefore in here we only wanna render this paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 280.14,
          "end": 281.553,
          "en": "if winner is set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 283.05,
          "end": 285.6,
          "en": "and on the other hand, if not winner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 285.6,
          "end": 288.18,
          "en": "So if winner is not set, if it's undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 288.18,
          "end": 292.11,
          "en": "we wanna render a paragraph where we say it's a draw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 292.11,
          "end": 294,
          "en": "And here this project set up complaints",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294,
          "end": 295.89,
          "en": "about this single quote",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
